    <string name="cc_help_title">How to Play Chinese Checkers</string>
    <string name="cc_help_text">Race your marbles from your corner of the star to the opposite corner.\n\nOn your turn move one marble: step to a neighbouring empty hole, or hop over any marble to the empty hole right behind it. Hops can chain, so one turn can carry a marble a long way.\n\nThe first player to fill the opposite corner wins. If nobody gets there after 200 moves each, whoever is closest to home wins.</string>
