    <string name="ludo_help_title">How to Play Ludo</string>
    <string name="ludo_help_text">Roll the die and move one of your four tokens that many squares clockwise around the board.\n\nWith the default rules a token needs a six to leave the yard, and a six gives you another roll (three sixes in a row lose the turn). Land on a rival\'s token to send it back to its yard, unless it is on a safe square: a start square or a star.\n\nTake all four tokens round and up your coloured home column to win. With Exact roll on, the last step needs the exact number.</string>
